      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0060",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这是教三旅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0061",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 61,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0061",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：七团、八团，九团就是六支队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0062",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 62,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0062",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：你们这儿是教二旅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0063",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 63,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0063",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：我这里，陈（士榘）支队的机关就带着他的一团调到鲁南，他的一团编为四团，我那个部队编为五团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0064",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 64,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0064",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：18：07"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0065",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 65,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0065",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：六团就是686团，报686团的番号，曾国华的旅长，原来确定是吴文玉的政委，以后他没有来，黄克诚把他弄到新四军三师当了政治部主任，所以叫符竹庭当政委。冀鲁边那里是教六旅，周贯五的政委，黄骅的副旅长，有个当地干部当旅长，结果当地干部这个人最后叛变了。还有一个教五旅，教五旅就是罗帅去湖西的时候确定，就把梁兴初这个大队调到鲁南来，扩大成两个团，结果支援新四军嘛，他又过了陇海路，又过去了（杨永松笑）。这就六个旅说完了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0066",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 66,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0066",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：19：15"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0067",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 67,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0067",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：说了五个旅，教五旅说完了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0068",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 68,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0068",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：教一旅、教二旅，教一旅是我们那个旅嘛，教三旅杨勇那个，杨勇另外还有他带去的部队扩大的部队教四旅，教五旅是过了陇海路以南了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0069",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 69,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0069",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：梁兴初那个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0070",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 70,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0070",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：教六旅就是冀鲁边那个。所以编了六个教导旅。115师在高干会以后，统称调整了一下吧，所以每个地方都有一个主力旅，旅都兼着小军区，它下面有分区。分区不太大，工作斗争需要，两三个县有个小地委，有个小分区，这样的。    "
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0071",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 71,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0071",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0072",
      "document_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH06-DOC08",
      "segment_order": 72,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "10.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0072",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：这样的话呢，以后的坚持抗战，咱就不再讲他了，熬过困难时期以后都反攻了，我以后也走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH06-DOC08-S0073",
